<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss March car imports fall 1.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss March car imports fall 1.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss car imports fell by a provisional 1.2 percent in March to 23,036 cars from the same 1996 month for a cumulative 4.4 percent decline to 62,928 in the first three months of the year, the Swiss Car Importers Association said.</p>
<p>  Leading exporters	  March 1997	  March 1996</p>
<p>    Germany			  9,764	   11,220</p>
<p>    France			   3,418	   3,515</p>
<p>    Italy			    1,813	   1,793</p>
<p>    Japan			    5,470	   4,466</p>
<p>    Sweden			   732	     528</p>
<p>    Britain			  336	     283</p>
<p>    Korea			    443	     393</p>
<p>--Zurich Newsroom 41-1-2587340</p>
</text>
